Vivado to Linty

Generate Linty elaboration scripts from the open Vivado project. All files are generated in the .linty directory.

The only exported command is run, in the ::tclapp::linty::vivado_to_linty namespace.

  Vivado% package require ::tclapp::linty::vivado_to_linty
  Vivado% ::tclapp::linty::vivado_to_linty::run

The command writes read.ys and hierarchy.ys under .linty/yosys
in the parent of the Vivado project directory. Files that are not emitted,
such as EDIF, are printed to the console.
